<title>USA: Park Bancorp buys back 270,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Park Bancorp buys back 270,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Park Bancorp Inc said Monday it had completed the repurchase of 270,000 shares of the bank holding company's common stock.</p>
<p>Park Bancorp said it currently has 2,431,441 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The repurchases were made in the open market at a a price of 15-5/8, it said. The shares will be used for the company's stock-based incentive plan and for general corporate purposes, it said.</p>
<p>Shares of Park Bancorp were off 1/2 at 15.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
